    [2.8] Fix job timeout status in list_jobs (#4552)
    
    ### Description
    
    When a job pod is launched but the resources it required are not
    available, the job pod wait in pending phase until timeout. The server
    does not properly set the job status and list_jobs shows RUNNING.
    
    This PR fixes the server/client runner and other related portions. Also
    add one job status in k8s to explicit inform the job failure reason.
    
